{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772845883188,"story":{"title":"Rosie and the Grumble Grove","userPrompt":"Beauty and the beast","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"fluent","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Rosie loved her family, even when they were loud. Her papa sang off-key, and her sisters giggled like wind chimes. But Rosie loved the quiet best. One day, Papa got lost in the Grumble Grove, a place where the trees had frowns and berries tasted like old socks. Rosie knew she had to find him.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie stands in a sunny meadow, looking determined. Her papa and sisters are in the background, depicted in a slightly exaggerated, comical way. The meadow is full of colorful wildflowers. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: bright and warm.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635440352,"durationMs":5947,"retries":0,"promptLength":768,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie surrounded by her family, Papa singing off-key, sisters giggling. Rosie looks thoughtful. Inset image: A dark, frowning Grumble Grove. in Home, possibly the living room or kitchen. A glimpse of the Grumble Grove in an inset.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"She packed a bag with lemon drops and a song her grandma taught her. “Grumble Grove, here I come!” she cried, though her voice trembled just a bit. The trees near the grove seemed to lean away, whispering secrets she couldn't quite hear. She walked on, her heart thump-thumping.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie walks towards a dark, gnarled forest edge. The trees look slightly menacing but not scary. She has a small satchel. The color palette is shifting from bright to slightly muted, but still colorful. Rosie has a brave but slightly worried expression. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635470337,"durationMs":5133,"retries":0,"promptLength":785,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie setting off with her bag, looking determined but slightly nervous, towards the edge of the Grumble Grove. The trees seem to lean away from her. in Edge of the enchanted forest, approaching the Grumble Grove.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Inside the Grove, everything was gray and tangled. Little grumpy gnomes hid behind mushrooms, shaking their tiny fists. “Go away!” they squeaked. Rosie offered them a lemon drop. They sniffed it suspiciously, then popped it in their mouths. Their frowns turned upside down!","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie offers a lemon drop to a group of small, grumpy gnomes. The gnomes have exaggerated features but are not scary. The setting is a tangled forest floor with large mushrooms. Color palette: muted greens and browns, with a pop of bright yellow from the lemon drop. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635440835,"durationMs":6429,"retries":0,"promptLength":736,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie offering a lemon drop to a group of grumpy gnomes hiding behind mushrooms. Some gnomes are sniffing the lemon drop skeptically, while others are starting to smile. in Inside the Grumble Grove.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"“Have you seen my papa?” Rosie asked. The gnomes pointed to a tall, twisty tower made of thorny vines. “He’s up there with the Grumble Beast,” one gnome said. “He sings terrible songs,” another wailed, “and the Beast hates singing!” Rosie’s heart sank. She had to save her papa.","illustrationPrompt":"The gnomes point towards a tall, twisty tower made of vines. Rosie looks up at the tower with a mixture of concern and determination. The tower looks imposing but not overly scary. Color palette: darker greens and browns, with a hint of light filtering through the vines. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635483559,"durationMs":4707,"retries":0,"promptLength":713,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie listening to the gnomes pointing towards a tall, thorny tower. Rosie looks worried. in Inside the Grumble Grove, near the thorny tower.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Rosie climbed the tower, dodging prickly thorns and grumpy spiders. Each step creaked and groaned. Finally, she reached the top. There was her papa, singing a very loud, very off-key song to a big, furry creature with sad eyes.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie climbs the vine-covered tower, looking determined. She is surrounded by cartoonish spiders and thorns. The color palette is muted greens and browns, with patches of bright light. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635445553,"durationMs":5199,"retries":0,"promptLength":683,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie reaching the top of the tower, seeing her papa singing to the Grumble Beast. The Grumble Beast looks miserable. in Top of the thorny tower.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"The Grumble Beast covered his ears with his paws. “Stop! Please stop!” he roared. Papa looked surprised. “But I’m trying to cheer you up!” he said. Rosie stepped forward. “Papa,” she said gently, “maybe singing isn’t the best way.”.","illustrationPrompt":"Inside the tower, Rosie's papa is singing loudly to a large, furry Grumble Beast who is covering his ears. Rosie looks at them both with a kind expression. Color palette: warm, inviting colors, with a focus on the expressions of the characters. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635446133,"durationMs":5295,"retries":0,"promptLength":701,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. The Grumble Beast covering his ears, begging Papa to stop singing. Papa looks surprised and confused. Rosie is stepping forward gently. in Top of the thorny tower.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"Rosie pulled out her grandma’s song. It was a quiet, gentle lullaby. She sang it softly, and the Grumble Beast’s eyes began to close. He wasn’t a scary beast at all, just a lonely one. He missed his family, far away.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie sings a lullaby to the Grumble Beast, who is now looking peaceful and sleepy. Papa watches them with a surprised but happy expression. The color palette is soft and calming, with gentle lighting. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635454214,"durationMs":8658,"retries":0,"promptLength":689,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie singing her grandma's lullaby to the Grumble Beast. The Grumble Beast's eyes are starting to close, looking peaceful. in Top of the thorny tower.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"“You miss your family?” Rosie asked. The Grumble Beast nodded sadly. He told them how he’d wandered into the Grove and couldn’t find his way back. Rosie had an idea. She knew the way out, and maybe… maybe she could help him find his family too.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie looks at the Grumble Beast with compassion. The Beast looks sad and lonely. Papa is patting the Beast's back. The color palette is warm and inviting, emphasizing the connection between the characters. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635453497,"durationMs":7686,"retries":0,"promptLength":674,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie talking to the Grumble Beast, who is nodding sadly. Papa is standing nearby, looking on with interest. in Top of the thorny tower.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"They led the Grumble Beast out of the Grove, past the gnomes (who were now eating all the lemon drops), and into the bright sunshine. Rosie sang her grandma’s song all the way. It seemed to guide them, like a tiny, tuneful compass.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie, Papa, and the Grumble Beast walk out of the Grumble Grove into a sunny meadow. The gnomes are in the background, happily eating lemon drops. The color palette is bright and cheerful. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635453458,"durationMs":7323,"retries":0,"promptLength":690,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie, Papa, and the Grumble Beast leaving the Grumble Grove. The gnomes are happily eating lemon drops. Rosie is singing. in Exiting the Grumble Grove.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"Finally, they reached a field of sparkling flowers. And there, in the distance, was a group of Grumble Beasts, waving their furry arms. The Grumble Beast roared with joy and ran to them. It was a happy reunion!","illustrationPrompt":"The Grumble Beast runs towards a group of other Grumble Beasts in a field of flowers. Rosie and Papa watch with happy smiles. The color palette is vibrant and joyful. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635458659,"durationMs":5198,"retries":0,"promptLength":670,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. The Grumble Beast reuniting with his family in a field of flowers. Rosie and Papa are waving goodbye. in Field of sparkling flowers.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":11,"text":"Rosie and her papa waved goodbye and walked home, hand in hand. Papa didn’t sing, but he hummed a happy tune. Rosie knew that even the grumpiest places could be made brighter with a little kindness and a song.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie and her papa walk home, hand in hand, through a sunny field. They both have happy expressions. The color palette is warm and inviting. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635518571,"durationMs":5804,"retries":0,"promptLength":712,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie and Papa walking home hand-in-hand. Papa is humming. in Path leading home from the field of flowers.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":12,"text":"When they got home, Rosie’s sisters ran to hug them. Papa gave them each a lemon drop. Rosie knew, deep in her heart, that family – loud, quiet, or even a little bit grumpy – was the best adventure of all. And that night, she dreamt of singing lullabies to furry beasts under a sky full of stars.","illustrationPrompt":"Rosie is hugged by her sisters, while Papa smiles and offers them lemon drops. They are standing in front of their cozy home, with warm light spilling from the windows. The color palette is warm and inviting, emphasizing the love and connection between the family members. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635461521,"durationMs":7305,"retries":0,"promptLength":756,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A 7-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, with medium dark curly brown hair in natural curls with a small side part, big-expressive warm chocolate brown eyes with curious and eager expression, wearing cozy sweater with star pattern and comfortable pants, with small backpack, rosy cheeks, gap-toothed smile, small dimple on left cheek. Rosie being hugged by her sisters. Papa is giving them lemon drops. Inset: Rosie dreaming of singing to a Grumble Beast under the stars. in Home, possibly the living room or kitchen. Inset: Dream scene under the stars.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProvider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635419366,"totalDurationMs":52364,"textGenerationMs":1,"imageGenerationMs":85826,"totalImages":13,"successfulImages":13,"failedImages":0,"appVersion":"2.5.15","buildVersion":"40","firstBatchImageMs":21469,"timeToDisplayMs":21470},"coverImageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772635471729,"durationMs":10187,"retries":0,"promptLength":1233,"success":true,"prom